          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "New Super Mario Bros. 2 is a side-scrolling 2.5D action-adventure platform game for the Nintendo 3DS. As the direct sequel to New Super Mario Bros., it is an indirect follow-up to New Super Mario Bros. Wii. The game's main focus is on coins, with the primary goal being to collect one million. To reach the goal, the game includes many new items to aid the player, such as the Gold Flower, which turns Mario into Gold Mario.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "New Super Mario Bros. 2 es un juego de acción y aventuras de plataformas en 2.5D con desplazamiento lateral para Nintendo 3DS. Como secuela directa de New Super Mario Bros., es una continuación indirecta de New Super Mario Bros. Wii. Su enfoque principal son las monedas, y el objetivo principal es reunir un millón. Para lograrlo, el juego incluye muchos objetos nuevos que ayudan al jugador, como la Flor Dorada, que convierte a Mario en Mario Dorado.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2012",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
